{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07308","headline":"送史判官奏事之灵武兼寄巴西亲故 · 刘长卿","name":"送史判官奏事之灵武兼寄巴西亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中州日纷梗，天地何时泰。\n独有西归心，遥悬夕阳外。\n故人奉章奏，此去论利害。\n阳雁南渡江，征骖去相背。\n因君欲寄远，何处问亲爱。\n空使沧洲人，相思减衣带。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}